<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Mot de passe oublié — Golden Logistics</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="{{ asset('images/Logo essai.png') }}">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.1/font/bootstrap-icons.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        *, *::before, *::after { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }
        html, body { height:100%; font-family:'Inter',sans-serif; background:#f8fafc; color:#111827; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; min-height:100vh; }

        .card {
            background:#fff; border-radius:1.25rem;
            box-shadow:0 8px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.1);
            width:100%; max-width:440px;
            padding:2.5rem 2.25rem;
            margin:1rem;
        }

        .logo { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.65rem; margin-bottom:2rem; }
        .logo img { height:44px; width:auto; object-fit:contain; }
        .logo span { font-size:1.1rem; font-weight:800; color:#111827; letter-spacing:-.02em; }

        .icon-wrap {
            width:64px; height:64px; border-radius:1rem;
            background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eff6ff,#dbeafe);
            display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
            font-size:1.8rem; color:#2563eb; margin-bottom:1.25rem;
        }

        h2 { font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:800; color:#111827; letter-spacing:-.03em; margin-bottom:.35rem; }
        .sub { font-size:.875rem; color:#6b7280; line-height:1.6; margin-bottom:1.75rem; }

        .row-2 { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:.85rem; }

        .field { margin-bottom:1.1rem; }
        .field label { display:block; font-size:.79rem; font-weight:600; color:#374151; margin-bottom:.38rem; }
        .inp-w { position:relative; }
        .inp-w i { position:absolute; left:.9rem; top:50%; transform:translateY(-50%); color:#9ca3af; font-size:.85rem; pointer-events:none; }
        .inp-w input {
            width:100%; padding:.78rem 1rem .78rem 2.6rem;
            border:1.5px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:.7rem;
            font-size:.88rem; font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
            color:#111827; background:#f9fafb; outline:none;
            transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s,background .2s;
        }
        .inp-w input:focus { border-color:#2563eb; box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(37,99,235,.1); background:#fff; }
        .inp-w input::placeholder { color:#d1d5db; }

        .notice {
            background:#eff6ff; border:1px solid #bfdbfe; border-radius:.75rem;
            padding:.85rem 1rem; margin-bottom:1.5rem;
            font-size:.8rem; color:#1d4ed8; line-height:1.6;
            display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:.6rem;
        }
        .notice i { flex-shrink:0; margin-top:.1rem; }

        .btn {
            width:100%; padding:.85rem; background:#2563eb; color:#fff;
            border:none; border-radius:.7rem; font-size:.92rem; font-weight:700;
            cursor:pointer; font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
            display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:.5rem;
            box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(37,99,235,.35);
            transition:background .2s,transform .15s,box-shadow .2s;
        }
        .btn:hover { background:#1d4ed8; transform:translateY(-1px); box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(37,99,235,.45); }

        .back { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:.4rem; margin-top:1.25rem; font-size:.83rem; color:#6b7280; text-decoration:none; transition:color .2s; }
        .back:hover { color:#2563eb; }

        .alert { padding:.75rem 1rem; border-radius:.7rem; margin-bottom:1.1rem; display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:.6rem; font-size:.83rem; }
        .alert-danger  { background:#fef2f2; border:1px solid #fecaca; color:#dc2626; }
        .alert-success { background:#f0fdf4; border:1px solid #bbf7d0; color:#15803d; }
        .alert i { flex-shrink:0; margin-top:.1rem; }

        .alert-dev { background:#fefce8; border:2px dashed #f59e0b; border-radius:.75rem; padding:1rem 1.1rem; margin-bottom:1.1rem; }
        .alert-dev-title { font-size:.8rem; font-weight:700; color:#92400e; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.4rem; margin-bottom:.4rem; }
        .alert-dev-sub { font-size:.76rem; color:#78350f; margin-bottom:.5rem; }
        .alert-dev-link { display:block; font-size:.72rem; color:#2563eb; word-break:break-all; background:#fff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:.5rem; padding:.5rem .7rem; text-decoration:none; }
        .alert-dev-link:hover { text-decoration:underline; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="card">

        <div class="logo">
            <img src="{{ asset('images/Logo essai.png') }}" alt="Golden Logistics">
            <span>Golden Logistics</span>
        </div>

        {% for msg in app.flashes('success') %}
        <div class="alert alert-success"><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i><span>{{ msg }}</span></div>
        {% endfor %}
        {% for msg in app.flashes('error') %}
        <div class="alert alert-danger"><i class="bi bi-exclamation-circle-fill"></i><span>{{ msg }}</span></div>
        {% endfor %}
        {% for url in app.flashes('dev_link') %}
        <div class="alert-dev">
            <div class="alert-dev-title"><i class="bi bi-tools"></i> Mode développement — Email non envoyé (SMTP non configuré)</div>
            <div class="alert-dev-sub">Cliquez sur ce lien pour réinitialiser le mot de passe :</div>
            <a href="{{ url }}" class="alert-dev-link">{{ url }}</a>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}

        <div class="icon-wrap"><i class="bi bi-person-lock"></i></div>
        <h2>Mot de passe oublié ?</h2>
        <p class="sub">Entrez votre prénom et nom. Le lien de réinitialisation sera envoyé automatiquement à l'adresse email enregistrée sur votre compte.</p>

        <div class="notice">
            <i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i>
            <span>Le lien est envoyé uniquement à l'email associé à votre compte — vous n'avez pas à le saisir.</span>
        </div>

        <form method="post">
            <div class="row-2">
                <div class="field">
                    <label for="firstName">Prénom</label>
                    <div class="inp-w">
                        <i class="bi bi-person"></i>
                        <input type="text" id="firstName" name="firstName" placeholder="Votre prénom" required autofocus>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="field">
                    <label for="lastName">Nom</label>
                    <div class="inp-w">
                        <i class="bi bi-person"></i>
                        <input type="text" id="lastName" name="lastName" placeholder="Votre nom" required>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <button type="submit" class="btn">
                <i class="bi bi-send"></i> Envoyer le lien de réinitialisation
            </button>
        </form>

        <a href="{{ path('app_login') }}" class="back">
            <i class="bi bi-arrow-left"></i> Retour à la connexion
        </a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>